# {{.DisplayName}}

Product repository built on [Shopanda](https://github.com/akarso/shopanda).

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Product plugin | [`plugins/{{.Slug}}/`](plugins/{{.Slug}}/) |
| Upstream | Shopanda (`upstream` remote, fetch-only) |
| Local checks | `make check` / `bash scripts/ci/unit.sh` |
| CI/CD | Optional — see [`ci-samples/README.md`](ci-samples/README.md) |

## Remotes

```bash
git remote -v
# origin    → this product repository (push here)
# upstream  → https://github.com/akarso/shopanda.git  (fetch upgrades only)

git remote set-url --push upstream DISABLED
```

Pin and upgrade procedure: `docs/guides/PRODUCT_SITES.md` and
`docs/runbooks/product-fork-upgrade.md`.

## Bring-up

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# Set SHOPANDA_AUTH_JWT_SECRET and SHOPANDA_DEV_MODE=true for local boot.
go build -o app ./cmd/api
./app setup
./app dev
```

Health (when the plugin is registered): `GET /api/{{.Slug}}/health`
